1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 💞 Erik Lorentz Armfelt is [https://www.geni.com/path/Eric-af-Kumo+is+related+to+Erik-Lorentz-Armfelt?from=6000000019395507263&path_type=blood&to=6000000009247257011 '''Eric Larsson af Kumo's'''] 10th great grandson
