2 CONT
2 CONT * Magnus Mauritz Höjer, [https://books.google.com/books?id=kNtAAAAAIAAJ&pg=PA339&lpg=PA339&dq=Rosenstierna+qvistrum&source=bl&ots=SK4BrMmq_-&sig=Jd0hFdnA0HJkY2GxvURILzRyPYw&hl=en&sa=X&ei=PzCHVYPqKZWcyQT2iqSAAQ&ved=0CCMQ6AEwAQ#v=on
2 CONC epage&q=Rosenstierna%20qvistrum&f=false Konungariket Sverige: delen. 1.-2. afd. Götaland] (1881), 339
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://www.uknadalen.se/?page_id=42
