2 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Armfelt_nr_458#TAB_19
2 CONT
2 CONT Asui Juvan kartanossa Tarvasjoella 1703 - 1719
2 CONT
2 CONT --
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Margrethe Finkenberg, wife of Captn. Armfelt is recorded as being a godmother at the christening of Catarina Juliana Berg 1712  – who incidentally is the same age as Eva Juliana as a godparent.  The parents of Catarina Julian
2 CONC a Berg b. 1712 were Christian Berg of Marttila Huovaristo and Catarina Elisabeth von Jordan.  Eva Juliana Ryden is Caterina Elisabeth von Jordan's younger sister (b. 1680) and is documented as the godmother of Catherina Juliana.
2 CONT
2 CONT This seems to prove the connection of the von Jordans of Pori (Ulvila, Nakkila, Leistila, Bjornborg) with Caterina Elisabeth von Jordan/Berg of Marttila.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://astia.narc.fi/uusiastia/viewer/?fileId=5964053028&aineistoId=1257567939
2 CONT
