2 GIVN Erik Andersson
2 SURN Kiorbiauw
2 _MARNM Lilliebrunn till Monikkala
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 ADDR
3 STAE Scotland
1 DEAT
2 DATE BEF 13 MAY 1646
