2 CONC ated in the Järva region of Estonia (in Estonian: Järva maakond or Järvamaa). Berndt Otto von Stackelberg was married to Baroness Margareta Elisabeth Maidel from 1696 until his death on August 29, 1734.  Source provided by Katrin 
