1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Margareta Juliana Sevonia, Born the 28th of Oct 1752 in Paimio to Benjamin Henriksson Sevonius & Helena Juliana Rehbinder. 
2 CONT Greta Juljana Sevonius married Johan Ezelius the younger, not the older—That would be quite an unsettling age gap even seldom seen back then, considering Margareta was 20 and Ezelius around sixty. 
