1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Petter_Adolf_Karsten '''Petter Adolf Karsten'''] was a Finnish [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mycology mycologist], the foremost expert on the fungi of Finland in his day, and known i
2 CONC n consequence as the "'''''father of Finnish mycology'''''".
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Karsten was born''' in Merimasku near Turku, studied at the University of Helsinki, and then moved to the inland of Tammela, where he spent most of his life with teaching botany and doing research at the Mustiala Agriculture In
2 CONC stitute (now the Faculty of Agriculture of the HAMK University of Applied Sciences).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''He amassed a''' vast collection, both by his own efforts and those of his correspondents, and named about 200 new genera and 2,000 new species. In his mycological studies he extensively used the microscope and can be considered
2 CONC  as the pioneer of fungal microscopy. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karstenia '''Karstenia'''] is a genus of fungi in the order [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rhytismatales '''Rhytismatales''']. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://karstenia.fi '''Karstenia'''], The International Journal of Mycology published by the [http://www.funga.fi Finnish Mycological Society], is dedicated to Karsten.
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.ipni.org/a/4659-1 International Plant Names Index (IPNI)], taxonomy, '''P.Karst'''. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://web.archive.org/web/20060510021104/http://www.fmnh.helsinki.fi/users/harmaja/Karsten.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Works:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Icones selectæ Hymenomycetum Fenniæ nondum delineatorum. Fasc. 1, Tab. I-9. Helsingfors 1887
2 CONT * Icones selectæ Hymenomycetum Fenniæ nondum delineatorum. Fasc. 2, Tab. 1-11. Helsingfors 1887
2 CONT * Icones selectæ Hymenomycetum Fenniæ nondum delineatorum. Fasc. 3. Helsingfors 1887
2 CONT * Icones selectæ Hymenomycetum Fenniæ nondum delineatorum : editæ sub auspiciis Societatis scientiarum fennicæ : fasciculus tertius. Acta Societatis scientiarum Fennicae Tomus XVIII. Helsingfors 1891
2 CONT * Finlands mögelsvampar (Hyphomycetes Fennici). Bidrag till kännedom av Finlands natur och folk häft 51. Finska Vetenskaps-Societeten, Helsingfors 1892
2 CONT * Kritisk öfversigt af Finlands Basidsvampar : tillägg I. Bidrag till kännedom av Finlands natur och folk häft 51. Finska Vetenskaps-Societeten, Helsingfors 1892
2 CONT * Symbolae ad mycologiam fennicam, pars XXXIII. Acta Societas pro fauna et flora Fennica Vol. IX, 1. Societas pro fauna et flora Fennica, Helsingfors 1893
2 CONT * Kritisk öfversigt af Finlands Basidsvampar : tillägg II. Bidrag till kännedom av Finlands natur och folk häft 54. Finska Vetenskaps-Societeten, Helsingfors 1894
2 CONT * Finlands basidsvampar i urval beskrifna. Floristiska handböcker för nybegynnare, utgifna af Societas pro fauna et flora Fennica I. Helsingfors 1899
2 CONT * Kritisk öfversigt af Finlands Basidsvampar : tillägg III. Bidrag till kännedom av Finlands natur och folk häft 62. Finska Vetenskaps-Societeten, Helsingfors 1903
2 CONT * Fungi novi nonnullis exceptis in Fennia lecti. Acta Societatis pro fauna et flora Fennica 27, 4. Kuopio 1906
2 CONT * Mycologia Fennica 1-4 ; Authorized repr. under the supervision of Hans Luther. J. Cramer-Johnson reprint corporation, New York, London 1966
2 CONT * Symbolae ad mycologiam Fennicam ; Authorized repr. with a biographical introd. by Hans Luther. J. Cramer-Johnson reprint corporation, New York, London 1966
2 CONT * Collected mycological papers 1, Nrs. 1-20 ; chronologically arranged and ed. by L. Vogelenzang. Asher, Amsterdam 1973
2 CONT * Collected mycological papers 2, Nrs. 20-65 ; chronologically arranged and ed. by L. Vogelenzang. Asher, Amsterdam 1973
2 CONT * Collected mycological papers 3, Nrs. 66-80 ; chronologically arranged and ed. by L. Vogelenzang. Asher, Amsterdam 1973
2 CONT * Collected mycological papers 4, Nrs. 81-101 ; chronologically arranged and ed. by L. Vogelenzang. Asher, Amsterdam 1973
2 CONT
2 CONT <br/>
2 CONT <br/>
