1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00495354&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Gertruds all siblings were born between 1644-1650 and she was married in 1663. She was probably ”Öfverstinna Gertrud Elisabeth Wrangell” mentioned in Bjernå församlings vigselbok in 1712. Her husband and son-in-law owned
2 CONC  Näse Gård in Bjernå, Finland 1689-1720.  https://www.sukuhistoria.fi/sshy/sivut/jasenille/paikat.php?bid=34013&pnum=30
2 CONT
2 CONT She had probably fled from Estonia to Näse Gård before Russian troops occupied Estonia and Reval in 1710. Later she fled to Stockholm. She is mentioned in the List of refugees from Finland in Stockholm in 1714, 1715 and 1716 (Elis
2 CONC abet Gertrud Wrangel, Öfwerste Enkefru, Liewen Öfwerste) https://asiakas.kotisivukone.com/files/konstansuku.kotisivukone.com/Siirtolaisuus/Suomalaisia_Pakolaisia_Isovihanaikana_Ruotsissa.pdf
