1 NAME Johan //
2 GIVN Johan
2 SURN Staël von Holstein
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1636
2 ADDR
3 CITY Narva
3 STAE Virumaa
3 CTRY Estonia
1 DEAT
2 DATE 25 JAN 1703
2 ADDR
