2 CONC wa 1673; Referral Secretary for Russian Business in Kongl. Chancellor 1677; Envoyé to Russia 1680; Councilman in Stockholm 1681; Assessor in Svea Court 1693; Add 1698 f% (introd. 1699 under N: o 1363); Jemte Hofkanslären Frih. Ber
