1 NAME Wivika Westerling (Björnberg)
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 18 JUL 1823
2 ADDR
3 CITY Björneborg
3 STAE Satakunda
3 CTRY Stf Finland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 28 FEB 1907
2 ADDR
